; Goal:		Kernel model for Core 0.
;
; Resources used:
;   TIMER0 ALARM0 – 1-ms reference tick  (scheduler_callBackFast)
;   TIMER0 ALARM1 – 20-ms process quota  (Phase 3.3: timeout tracking only,
;                                          no preemptive stack switch)
;   ecall slot 11 – kernel message path  (kernel_message_C0 via ecall)
;
; Preemptive context switching from interrupt context requires saving the full
; 35-word process frame (KERN_SAVE_FRAME) and setting vSaveStack from the MEI
; handler. This is deferred to Phase 3.4. For Phase 3.3, context switches
; happen exclusively via ecall (process-initiated kernel calls).
;
; Exported routines:
;   model_kernel_init_C0
;   model_kernel_runKernel_C0
;   model_kernel_setLowPower_C0
;   model_kernel_readTickCount_C0
;   model_kernel_newProcessTimeout_C0
;   model_kernel_stopProcessTimeout_C0
;   kernel_message_C0   (called from syscallDispatcher via exce slot 11)
